{"ID":"20240314094754-q0duuq0","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240314094754-q0duuq0","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240314094754-q0duuq0\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422171616-68hfgn2\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422171616-jhqjy80\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422171616-jhqjy80\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:17,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:17\u0026#125;","title":"【矾石丸】","type":"doc","updated":"20240422171616"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240422171616-68hfgn2","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240422171616-68hfgn2","updated":"20240422171616"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"妇人经水闭不利，藏坚癖不止，中有干血，下白物，矾石丸主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240422171616-4snbxb8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171616-4snbxb8","updated":"20240422171616"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"矾石丸方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422171616-vpq3kha","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171616-vpq3kha","updated":"20240422171616"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"矾石三分烧、杏仁一分"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422171616-yqzvtjt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171616-yqzvtjt","updated":"20240422171616"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"右二味，末之，蜜丸枣核大，纳藏中，剧者再纳之。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422171616-ezbsm4y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171616-ezbsm4y","updated":"20240422171616"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"再来呢，这个矾石丸啊！你不要当药给他吃了，这不是吃的。“"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"妇人经水闭不利"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"”，月经停住了或者滴滴答答，那“"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脏坚癖不止，中有干血，下白物"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"”，这个脏指的就是子宫，那里面有干血会排很多白物出来，好象白带一样很厚的白带。也就是说，刚刚我讲的寒湿，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"你如果针下去、处方下去还没解决的时候，你可以外用药"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。这个矾石丸呢非常厉害，矾石这个药，我们用白矾石三分来烧，这里的三分跟一分呢，你就按照比例就好了，不要老是追究这个三跟一分，要追究这个三跟一比例。"}]},{"ID":"20240422171616-m2e0e8v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171616-m2e0e8v","updated":"20240422171616"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那如果你用矾石 3 钱，杏仁就用 1 钱嘛，那做成的量，你不会做得很大，根本塞不进去，他是做粉末嘛，所以要有点 commonsense，做成“"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"蜜丸枣核大"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"”，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"放入脏中，就是放到阴道里面"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。过去文人嘛，写的比较含蓄，不像我们比较粗鲁，那“"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"剧者再纳之"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"”，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"严重的再做第二次就好了"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240422171616-z6nyyl8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171616-z6nyyl8","updated":"20240422171616"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我们平常用的时候，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"你不要把这个药直接放进去哦，很烫，会烧坏里面的皮肤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，我们一般来说都是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"放到药袋里面，棉布袋里面放进去"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，那效果非常的好，非常的快。"}]},{"ID":"20240422171616-jhqjy80","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171616-jhqjy80","updated":"20240422171616"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"后边呢都会有几个处方来介绍这种药。"}]}]}